    {
      "handle": "toddzolecki.bsky.social",
      "author": "Todd Zolecki",
      "team": "フィリーズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Can the Phillies afford to sign somebody like Randy Arozarena or Seiya Suzuki to a lucrative, multiyear deal? Can they afford not to? ￼",
      "likes": 5,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-10-27T12:33:13.144Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:rynds6tzvo5ve3ah4yrhjztn/app.bsky.feed.post/3myuanag4pc22",
      "jp_players": [
        "Seiya Suzuki",
        "Suzuki"
      ],
      "jp": "フィリーズはランディ・アロザレーナや鈴木誠也クラスの選手と、高額の複数年契約を結べるのか。結ばないという選択はできるのか。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
      "author": "Andy Kostka",
      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "I know trade incentives and payroll considerations and roster construction and all of that — yes, I know. But damn, Cedric was an Oriole",
      "likes": 73,
      "reposts": 4,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-10-27T03:08:09.679Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3mytb2tkh6s2v",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "トレードの事情もペイロールも編成の都合も、もちろん分かってる。でもなあ、セドリックはオリオールズの選手だったのに"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
      "author": "Andy Kostka",
      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "Jared Banner on becoming the first Black GM of Orioles: \"Representation matters, and if there’s some little kid in Baltimore who sees me up here and thinks that they’re capable of something they might not have thought otherwise, that’s a big responsibility and something I take a lot of pride in.”",
      "likes": 66,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-10-27T16:16:39.432Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3myun4rnius2d",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ジャレッド・バナー、オリオールズ初の黒人GMに就任して。「Representation matters（誰かの姿が示す意味は大きい）。ボルチモアの子どもが私を見て、自分にもできると思ってくれるなら、それは大きな責任であり、誇りです」"
    },
    {
